{"id":63317,"date":"2026-08-24T10:35:53","date_gmt":"2026-08-24T09:35:53","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=63317"},"modified":"2026-09-27T22:52:06","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T21:52:06","slug":"ratis-by-night","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/ratis-by-night\/","title":{"rendered":"Ratis by Night 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Ratis by Night 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Ratis by Night 2026<\/strong> (1\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) \u00e9 um evento desportivo, cultural e solid\u00e1rio noturno promovido pela <strong>Junta de Freguesia de S\u00e3o Pedro de Rates<\/strong> atrav\u00e9s do projeto Rates Sa\u00fade+, em estreita parceria com o <strong>Munic\u00edpio da P\u00f3voa de Varzim<\/strong>. Com partida e chegada fixadas no <strong>Parque Verde<\/strong> (junto ao Rates Park), na hist\u00f3rica vila de <strong>S\u00e3o Pedro de Rates<\/strong>, o evento alia a pr\u00e1tica do exerc\u00edcio f\u00edsico ao lazer comunit\u00e1rio, sob o brilho do luar e com atmosfera de festa popular.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa contempla a <strong>Corrida Noturna de 10 km<\/strong> com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip da SincTime para maiores de 18 anos, e a <strong>Caminhada Noturna de 8,5 km<\/strong> aberta a todas as idades. O itiner\u00e1rio atravessa o encantador percurso do <strong>Ecomuseu de Rates<\/strong>, proporcionando momentos etnogr\u00e1ficos \u00fanicos com moleiro a moer milho, broa caseira quente acabada de cozer, m\u00fasica ao vivo e lumin\u00e1rias noturnas. A prova reverte a favor da aquisi\u00e7\u00e3o de bonecos de Suporte B\u00e1sico de Vida (SBV) para a\u00e7\u00f5es formativas na comunidade, garantindo a cada inscrito t-shirt oficial, lumin\u00e1ria, bifana e bebida no conv\u00edvio final.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 21:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Parque Verde, S\u00e3o Pedro de Rates, P\u00f3voa de Varzim, Porto<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 km (Corrida Noturna) e 8,5 km (Caminhada Noturna)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Junta de Freguesia de S\u00e3o Pedro de Rates e Munic\u00edpio da P\u00f3voa de Varzim<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.sinctime.com\/storage\/files\/eventos\/cce1\/4528\/1ed0\/4f3d\/9f76\/b1a2\/7a6b\/c680.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/><\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida Noturna 10K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 26 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 21:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 19 de Setembro:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (19\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Noturna 8,5K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 26 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 21:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 20 de Setembro:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (20\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida do Ratis by Night 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 26 de setembro de 2026, com partida simult\u00e2nea para a Corrida de 10 km e Caminhada de 8,5 km marcada para as 21:00 no Parque Verde (junto ao Rates Park), em S\u00e3o Pedro de Rates.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde decorre a concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e quais as particularidades do percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e meta decorrem no Parque Verde de Rates, concelho da P\u00f3voa de Varzim. O percurso nocturno percorre o circuito do Ecomuseu de Rates, incluindo passagens com moleiro tradicional, broa caseira e anima\u00e7\u00e3o com m\u00fasica ao vivo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que inclui o kit de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem o valor de 12,00 \u20ac (tanto na corrida como na caminhada) e inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, lumin\u00e1ria noturna obrigat\u00f3ria, chip de cronometragem (para a corrida de 10 km), seguro desportivo, abastecimentos e uma bifana e bebida no conv\u00edvio final.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o car\u00e1cter solid\u00e1rio associado a esta prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento, integrado no Projeto Rates Sa\u00fade+, reverte fundos para a aquisi\u00e7\u00e3o de manequins de treino em Suporte B\u00e1sico de Vida (SBV), com vista a a\u00e7\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o em emerg\u00eancia para alunos da Escola E, B, 2, 3 de Rates, popula\u00e7\u00e3o e empresas locais.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem pode participar na caminhada e na corrida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Corrida de 10 km destina-se a atletas com idade igual ou superior a 18 anos. A Caminhada de 8,5 km n\u00e3o possui limite et\u00e1rio, sendo acess\u00edvel a crian\u00e7as e fam\u00edlias (menores devem fazer-se acompanhar por um adulto respons\u00e1vel).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Ratis by Night 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-26\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Pedro de Rates, P\u00f3voa de Varzim\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"P\u00f3voa de Varzim\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida do Ratis by Night 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 26 de setembro de 2026, com partida simult\u00e2nea para a Corrida de 10 km e Caminhada de 8,5 km marcada para as 21:00 no Parque Verde (junto ao Rates Park), em S\u00e3o Pedro de Rates.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde decorre a concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e quais as particularidades do percurso?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e meta decorrem no Parque Verde de Rates, concelho da P\u00f3voa de Varzim. O percurso nocturno percorre o circuito do Ecomuseu de Rates, incluindo passagens com moleiro tradicional, broa caseira e anima\u00e7\u00e3o com m\u00fasica ao vivo.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que inclui o kit de participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem o valor de 12,00 \u20ac (tanto na corrida como na caminhada) e inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, lumin\u00e1ria noturna obrigat\u00f3ria, chip de cronometragem (para a corrida de 10 km), seguro desportivo, abastecimentos e uma bifana e bebida no conv\u00edvio final.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o car\u00e1cter solid\u00e1rio associado a esta prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento, integrado no Projeto Rates Sa\u00fade+, reverte fundos para a aquisi\u00e7\u00e3o de manequins de treino em Suporte B\u00e1sico de Vida (SBV), com vista a a\u00e7\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o em emerg\u00eancia para alunos da Escola E, B, 2, 3 de Rates, popula\u00e7\u00e3o e empresas locais.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem pode participar na caminhada e na corrida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Corrida de 10 km destina-se a atletas com idade igual ou superior a 18 anos. A Caminhada de 8,5 km n\u00e3o possui limite et\u00e1rio, sendo acess\u00edvel a crian\u00e7as e fam\u00edlias (menores devem fazer-se acompanhar por um adulto respons\u00e1vel).\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67737,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-63317","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-sao-pedro-de-rates-povoa-de-varzim","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type_2-porto","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_4-solidaria-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-ratis-by-night.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/63317","targetHints"